## NocoDB Database (`TD_App` — 16 bảng)

| Bảng | Module |
|---|---|
| `INV_Accounts` | Auth (đăng nhập) |
| `INV_Invoices` | Invoice |
| `INV_Banks` | Invoice (thông tin ngân hàng) |
| `td_invoice_clients` | Invoice (khách hàng) |
| `td_invoice_studios` | Invoice (thông tin studio) |
| `Customers` | CRM |
| `Projects` | CRM |
| [Account](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts#74-79) | CRM / Shared |
| `PM_Tasks_Tracking` | Workforce (tasks) |
| `PM_Tracking_Configs` | Workforce (cấu hình) |
| `ListMappings` | Workforce (ClickUp mapping) |
| `SyncConfigs` | Workforce (ClickUp sync config) |
| `SyncMessages` | Workforce (sync log) |
| `DriveConfigs` | Workforce (Google Drive) |
| `NameMappings` | Workforce (mapping tên) |
| `Settings` | Global settings |

---

